OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas switch-on to go ahead
OL,4,Adespite rat fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas switch-on event in Cotgrave
OL,7,Fis to go ahead as planned despite
OL,8,Fconcerns about rats at the venue.
OL,10,FThe Christmas Market event along with a
OL,11,Ffestive lights switch-on is taking
OL,12,Fplace at Cotgrave Shopping Centre on 20
OL,13,FNovember.
OL,15,FHowever, concerns had been raised after
OL,16,Frats were seen within the precinct,
OL,17,Fprompting a "treatment programme" to
OL,18,Ftackle the issue.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
