OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas switch-on to go ahead
OL,4,Adespite rat fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FCotgrave Town Council said it had been
OL,7,Freassured there was "not a significant
OL,8,Frisk to public health to cancel the
OL,9,Fevent" and said the issue would be
OL,10,Fmonitored.
